    'The pages these links point at have moved for good, and your content still carries the old addresses. The links still work, but they are worth updating.' => 'The pages these links point at have moved for good, and your content still carries the old addresses. The links still work, but they are worth updating.',
    'The plugin already knows the usual suspects; these are added to that list. A refusal from one of them is reported as unverifiable rather than broken, and is never counted against you, because a link nobody can check is not the same as a link that is gone.' => 'The plugin already knows the usual suspects; these are added to that list. A refusal from one of them is reported as unverifiable rather than broken, and is never counted against you, because a link nobody can check is not the same as a link that is gone.',
